window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It's called \"the event\", an unimaginable cataclysm that shatters 600 million years of the Earth's timeline.</p> <p>Our world is gone, instantly replaced by a new one made of scattered remnants of the past, present, and future, dropped alongside one another in a patchwork of \"shards\". Monsters from Jurassic prehistory, ancient armies, and high-tech robots all coexist in this deadly post-apocalyptic landscape.</p> <p>A desperate group of survivors sets out to locate the source of the disaster. They include 21st-century Californian Amber Richardson, Cam, a young Celtic warrior from Roman Britannia, Alex Brice, a policewoman from 1985, and Blake, a British soldier from World War II. With other refugees from across time, they must learn the truth behind the Event, if they are to survive.</p>"; 
